Package: stockSeasonalityAnalysis
Type: Project
Title: Seasonality in Primary Care Prescribing in England
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: Reproducible project environment metadata for the one-off
    prescribing seasonality analysis. This is not an installable software
    package; Imports is the explicit list of direct analysis dependencies.
